df7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"所性侄家藏东坡看竹图","author":"欧阳玄","text":"银烛高烧照艳妆，繁华过眼已相忘。\n敲门自爱看修竹，未必殷勤为海棠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24425,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"漫题二绝 其一","author":"欧阳玄","text":"铃索无声玉漏稀，青绫夜直月侵扉。\n五更一觉梅花梦，催得江南学士归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24426,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"漫题二绝 其二","author":"欧阳玄","text":"属官分住省郎曹，省树年深过屋高。\n翰长昼閒来啜茗，下帘危坐听松涛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24427,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"为浪溪题折枝海棠","author":"欧阳玄","text":"点缀春风只一枝，此花犹是半开时。\n更令老杜如今见，便是无情也赋诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24428,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨竹","author":"欧阳玄","text":"两枝淡淡与浓浓，垂叶应无靃靡容。\n玉立满身都是雨，何人能识葛陂龙？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24429,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"高宗御书","author":"欧阳玄","text":"君王不受辟寒钗，永巷泥金进损斋。\n欲上太清楼下石，啼鸦落日满宫槐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24430,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陈抟睡图","author":"欧阳玄","text":"陈桥一夜柘袍黄，天下都无鼾睡床。\n赢得坠驴閒老子，为君眠断白云乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24431,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪夜访戴图","author":"欧阳玄","text":"雪夜操舟童仆劳，偶然归去便称豪。\n若为返棹成佳趣，转忆当时不出高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24432,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨荔枝","author":"欧阳玄","text":"向来千里骑尘红，生色罗襦湿翠浓。\n颜色似嫌妃子涴，萧然犹有墨君风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":24433,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]